# Page Loading Error
<img src="https://github.com/cyberm3n-org/SC_2026/blob/main/ref_images/Reg_Error26_Front.png">

### Build List Items
| Ref | Value | Marking Color |
| D1 | White LED | Yellow |
| D2, D3, D4 | Red LED | Red |
| R1 | 20 | Brown |
| R2 | 300 | Pink |

### Steps
1. Solder LEDs
2. Solder Resistor
3. [OPTIONAL] Apply hot glue to difuse light
